2. Each of the following offences is prescribed as a compoundable offence that may be compounded in accordance with section 74(1) of the Act:
(a)an offence under section 11(1) or (2), 14 or 16(1) or (3) of the Act without involving a prohibited gun, a major part of a prohibited gun or a prohibited gun accessory;
(b)an offence under section 13(1) of the Act;
(c)an offence under section 15(1) of the Act for conveying a gun, a major part of a gun, or a gun accessory without involving a prohibited gun, a major part of a prohibited gun or a prohibited gun accessory;
(d)an offence under section 18(1), 19(3), 28(1) or 35(1) of the Act;
(e)an offence under section 22(1) or (3), 24(1) or 26(1) of the Act without involving a prohibited explosive;
(f)an offence under section 25(1) of the Act for conveying an explosive or explosive precursor without involving a prohibited explosive;
(g)an offence under section 29(1), 31 or 33(1) or (3) of the Act without involving a prohibited weapon;
(h)an offence under section 38(1), 47(1) or (2) or 48(2) of the Act;
(i)an offence under regulation 8(5) or 9(3) of the Guns, Explosives and Weapons Control (General Matters) Regulations 2025 (G.N. No. S 383/2025);
(j)an offence under regulation 44(5), 45(3), 46(1), (2) or (3) or 47(1) of the Guns, Explosives and Weapons Control (Shooting and Paintball Ranges) Regulations 2025 (G.N. No. S 360/2025);
(k)an offence under regulation 8(3) of the Guns, Explosives and Weapons Control (Security Clearance) Regulations 2025 (G.N. No. S 382/2025);
(l)an offence under regulation 64(1) or (2), 65, 66, 67, 68, 69(1) or (2) or 70 of the Guns, Explosives and Weapons Control (Guns) Regulations 2025 (G.N. No. S 359/2025);
(m)an offence under regulation 99(1) or (2), 100(1) or (2), 101(1), (2) or (3), 102, 103, 104(1) or (2), 105(1) or (2), 106(1) or (2), 107(1) or (2), 108 or 109 of the Guns, Explosives and Weapons Control (Explosives and Explosive Precursors) Regulations 2025 (G.N. No. S 374/2025);
(n)an offence under regulation 43, 44, 45(1) or (2) or 46 of the Guns, Explosives and Weapons Control (Weapons and Noxious Substances) Regulations 2025 (G.N. No. S 361/2025).
